          "description": "Before you make a D20 Test, you can gain Advantage on it. Once you do so, you must finish a Long Rest or cast a Sorcerer spell using a spell slot before you can use this feature again — doing the latter automatically triggers a roll on the Wild Magic Surge table.",
          "key": "tidesOfChaos",
          "label": "Tides of Chaos",
          "recharge": "longRest",
          "total": 1,
        },
        {
          "description": "Once per Long Rest, whenever you roll on the Wild Magic Surge table, you can replace the triggered effect with a Wild Magic Surge effect of your choice from the table, other than its final effect.",
          "key": "tamedSurge",
          "label": "Tamed Surge",
          "recharge": "longRest",
          "total": 1,
        },
      ],
    },
    "level": 20,
  },
]
`;

